WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.980
Three more Latin bases.

00:00:01.980 --> 00:00:06.890
Spect means look, so to respect someone is to look up to them.

00:00:06.890 --> 00:00:10.540
Ject means throw, so eject means throw out.

00:00:10.540 --> 00:00:16.390
Script and scribe mean write, and a scribe is a person whose job is writing.

00:00:16.390 --> 00:00:20.900
Find the base, and the word starts to explain itself.
